msgstr "YSec je zavrnil odstranitev datoteke MU, ki ni v njegovi lasti."

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1862
msgid ""
"YSec rejects abusive direct submissions before WordPress creates a comment. Normal comments that reach "
"Pending or the WordPress Spam queue remain WordPress moderation decisions, not YSec blocks."
msgstr ""
"YSec zavrne zlorabne neposredne oddaje, preden WordPress ustvari komentar. Običajni komentarji, ki dosežejo"
" Pending ali čakalno vrsto WordPress Spam, ostanejo odločitve moderiranja WordPress, ne blokade YSec."

